WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.258 --> 00:00:06.633
A mountain of lemons, and the bucket-chain lifts one lemon at a time!

3
00:00:07.356 --> 00:00:09.325
That would take all year!

4
00:00:10.047 --> 00:00:13.314
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:14.036 --> 00:00:16.665
This is Episode 76.

6
00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:19.262
Meet the snow-box.

7
00:00:19.985 --> 00:00:23.040
It is big, padded, and very tough.

8
00:00:23.762 --> 00:00:26.191
Maya fills it with the whole mountain.

9
00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:29.177
Click, the lid shuts.

10
00:00:29.899 --> 00:00:32.741
A truck drives it up the ramp to the cloud.

11
00:00:33.464 --> 00:00:37.591
Up top, the lid opens, and the whole mountain lands at once.

12
00:00:38.313 --> 00:00:41.851
When the pile is too big for the rope, you ship the box.

13
00:00:42.573 --> 00:00:45.380
That is the AWS Snow Family.

14
00:00:46.102 --> 00:00:50.547
Big tough boxes that carry huge piles of data to the cloud by truck.

15
00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.393
Now you know the snow-box!

16
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

